{"id":"5cca226c667d1aef","group":"58","path":"58/batch14/58-thm-ground-axiom.md","title":"Ground Axiom","display":"thm-ground-axiom — Ground Axiom","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-ground-axiom","aliases":["58-thm-ground-axiom"],"display":"thm-ground-axiom — Ground Axiom","depends_on":["[[../batch06/58-df-ground.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-ground-axiom"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-ground-axiom</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-ground-axiom — Ground Axiom"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d0244462250ae67e\" href=\"?note=d0244462250ae67e\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-ground.md\">../batch06/58-df-ground.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf V,W\\in\\mathsf{Cls}\">\\(\\mathbf V,W\\in\\mathsf{Cls}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GroundModel}_S\\subseteq\\mathsf{Cls}^2\">\\(\\mathrm{GroundModel}_S\\subseteq\\mathsf{Cls}^2\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d0244462250ae67e\" href=\"?note=d0244462250ae67e\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-ground.md\">../batch06/58-df-ground.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GA}\\in\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{GA}\\in\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf V\\coloneqq\\{x:x=x\\}\">\\(\\mathbf V\\coloneqq\\{x:x=x\\}\\)</span> 为全体集合组成的元理论宇宙类；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W\">\\(W\\)</span> 是类变量。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}ground\\text{-}axiom} \\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}} \\mathrm{GA} \\leftrightarrow\n\\neg\\exists W\\in\\mathsf{Cls}\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{GroundModel}_S(W,\\mathbf V)\\land W\\subsetneq\\mathbf V\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}ground\\text{-}axiom} \\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}} \\mathrm{GA} \\leftrightarrow\n\\neg\\exists W\\in\\mathsf{Cls}\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{GroundModel}_S(W,\\mathbf V)\\land W\\subsetneq\\mathbf V\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Ground Axiom states that the universe is not a nontrivial set-forcing extension of any proper inner model.</li>\n<li>Equivalently, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span> has no proper ground model; the trivial ground <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span> itself is not excluded.</li>\n<li>Compatible with many large cardinal axioms.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch06/58-df-ground.md","status":"resolved","id":"d0244462250ae67e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-ground.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch06/58-df-ground.md","status":"resolved","id":"d0244462250ae67e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{GroundModel}_S\\subseteq\\mathsf{Cls}^2$ (see [[../batch06/58-df-ground.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbf V,W\\in\\mathsf{Cls}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GroundModel}_S\\subseteq\\mathsf{Cls}^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GA}\\in\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf V\\coloneqq\\{x:x=x\\}","display":false},{"tex":"W","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}ground\\text{-}axiom} \\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}} \\mathrm{GA} \\leftrightarrow\n\\neg\\exists W\\in\\mathsf{Cls}\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{GroundModel}_S(W,\\mathbf V)\\land W\\subsetneq\\mathbf V\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"V","display":false},{"tex":"V","display":false}],"bytes":997,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4189","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-thm-ground-axiom.md|58-thm-ground-axiom]]（batch14）"}],"outgoing":["d0244462250ae67e"]}